<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://lizhangxin666.github.io//feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://lizhangxin666.github.io//" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-01-28T11:47:42+00:00</updated><id>https://lizhangxin666.github.io//feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>虚怀持敬 明志笃行 </subtitle><entry><title type="html">你好，世界！(Hello World)</title><link href="https://lizhangxin666.github.io//blog/2026/hello-world/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="你好，世界！(Hello World)"/><published>2026-01-28T02:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-01-28T02:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://lizhangxin666.github.io//blog/2026/hello-world</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://lizhangxin666.github.io//blog/2026/hello-world/"><![CDATA[<h2 id="欢迎来到你的随笔空间">欢迎来到你的随笔空间</h2> <p>这是你的第一篇文章。你可以在 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">_posts</code> 目录下创建新的 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">.md</code> 文件来添加更多文章。</p> <h3 id="如何写文章">如何写文章？</h3> <ol> <li><strong>文件名格式</strong>：<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">年-月-日-标题.md</code>，例如 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">2026-01-28-my-first-post.md</code></li> <li><strong>文件头 (Front Matter)</strong>： <div class="language-yaml highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="nn">---</span>
<span class="na">layout</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">post</span>
<span class="na">title</span><span class="pi">:</span>  <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">文章标题"</span>
<span class="na">date</span><span class="pi">:</span>   <span class="s">2026-01-28 12:00:00 +0800</span>
<span class="na">description</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s">文章简短描述</span>
<span class="na">tags</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="pi">[</span><span class="nv">标签1</span><span class="pi">,</span> <span class="nv">标签2</span><span class="pi">]</span>
<span class="na">categories</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="pi">[</span><span class="nv">分类</span><span class="pi">]</span>
<span class="nn">---</span>
</code></pre></div> </div> </li> <li><strong>正文</strong>：使用 Markdown 语法编写内容。</li> </ol> <p>祝你写作愉快！</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="日常"/><category term="随笔"/><category term="生活"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[这是你的第一篇随笔]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Displaying External Posts on Your al-folio Blog</title><link href="https://lizhangxin666.github.io//blog/2022/displaying-external-posts-on-your-al-folio-blog/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Displaying External Posts on Your al-folio Blog"/><published>2022-04-23T23:20:09+00:00</published><updated>2022-04-23T23:20:09+00:00</updated><id>https://lizhangxin666.github.io//blog/2022/displaying-external-posts-on-your-al-folio-blog</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://lizhangxin666.github.io//blog/2022/displaying-external-posts-on-your-al-folio-blog/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author></entry></feed>